+| M端控制与观测参考 | 内部助手 | solve_roll_height4.m / observe_roll_height4.m，供生成前数值验证和C端一致性核对 |
+
+```matlab
+addpath('tools/matlab/roll_height4');
+run_roll_height4
+% 可选：[ok,result] = run_roll_height4;
+```
